  "bodyHtml": "\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-md-8\">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-image-area\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-title-date no-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Guild Monthly General Meeting</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tecset-date\"><span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">April 17, 2027 @ 1:30 pm</span> - <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">4:00 pm</span></div>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-light-bg\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"epta-content-area\">\n\t\t   \t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content\">\n\t\t\t\t<p>From September to June Guild members gather for a short business meeting followed by a free and open to the public painting demonstration from well-known Cape Cod artists using a variety of mediums.  The 30-minute business meeting reviews Guild financials, past and upcoming events and other newsworthy topics.  <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7465\" src=\"/media/archive/9d77e272fb184fb403565c8da7998d1454f40b253fe1967e07db44314fe8afae.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"223\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7467\" src=\"/media/archive/8b11cf0266c6347057a057200dcc3f6efdbb7312eda3fa9377916ff31895c92d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-7468\" src=\"/media/archive/45b50a7683d0a5142fb6ae3b32823c49ae5c231f5ff783bccb453d16e0849583.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\n\n\t\t\t </div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"epta-map-area\">\n\t\t\t\n<div class=\"tribe-events-venue-map\">\n\t\n<p data-fidelity-note=\"embed\"><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/embed/v1/place?key=AIzaSyDNsicAsP6-VuGtAb1O9riI3oc_NOb7IOU&amp;q=100+Oak+Street+Harwich+MA+02645+United+States+&amp;zoom=10\">Google maps iframe displaying the address to Harwich Community Center</a></p>\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"col